&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The essential functions of this position include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
